      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get the risk but it's driving me crazy how lightheaded i get. my doctor is super hard to reach and usually takes like 3 days to call back. if i just took it a bit later in the day or maybe even took two tonight instead of one, wouldn't that help stabilize it faster so i don't have these dizzy spells tomorrow? it's just one day to get through it.",
