      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i hear you. but like, if i can't reach them, what am i supposed to do just suffer through it? im not saying i'll do it every day, just once to see if it helps. also i was reading online that sometimes people take a higher dose at night so the dizziness doesn't hit during the day. if i just took 20mg tonight instead of 10mg, wouldn't that basically just be a one-time thing to level me out? it seems way more logical than just sitting here feeling like i'm gonna pass out every time i move.",
